{
  "_readme": [
    "Licence clause table for ModelBrain. Load into the hub as (:License)-[:IMPOSES]->(:Clause).",
    "QUOTES ARE NOT STORED IN THIS REPO. At startup the Clause Loader fetches source_raw_url, normalises whitespace (HTML: strip script/style/tags, unescape entities), splits into units with the regex in 'split_regex', and stores the first unit matching 'locator' (case-insensitive) as Clause.quote, capped at 80 words with an ellipsis. Cache the fetched texts on disk for 7 days.",
    "If a locator finds nothing, or source_raw_url is null, the clause loads with effect NEEDS_COUNSEL and the loader logs a warning. Tests assert every locator_verified clause extracts a non-empty quote containing its locator.",
    "'summary' is our plain-English paraphrase for the UI; it is never shown as a quote.",
    "applies_when / check use the rule language in BLUEPRINT.md section 6.1."
  ],
